sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API
    participant IngestWorker
    participant StructureWorker
    participant LLM
    participant RenderWorker

    User->>API: POST /api/jobs {sourceUrl, templateId, generateText}
    API->>API: Create job (status: queued)
    API-->>User: {jobId, status: queued}

    Note over API,IngestWorker: Phase 0: Ingest
    API->>IngestWorker: Dequeue job
    IngestWorker->>IngestWorker: Scrape content from sourceUrl
    IngestWorker->>IngestWorker: Extract text, metadata
    IngestWorker->>API: Update job (status: ingested)
    API->>API: Publish to outbox → structure queue

    Note over StructureWorker,LLM: Phase 1: Content Extraction
    StructureWorker->>API: Dequeue job
    StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: Check checkpoint (resume support)
    StructureWorker->>LLM: getExtractionPrompt(content)
    LLM-->>StructureWorker: Content Brief (XML)
    StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: Write debug: 00-extracted.txt, 05-phase1-brief.xml

    par Phase 1.5 + 2: Parallel Execution
        Note over StructureWorker,LLM: Phase 1.5: Domain Classification
        StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: loadAllDomains() — 16 domains
        StructureWorker->>LLM: classifyDomainPrompt()
        LLM-->>StructureWorker: Domain ID (news, politics, etc.)
        StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: Write debug: 05b-domain-classification.xml
    and
        Note over StructureWorker,LLM: Phase 2: Template Selection
        StructureWorker->>LLM: getTemplateSelectionPrompt()
        LLM-->>StructureWorker: Selected Template ID
        StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: Write debug: 06-phase2-selection.xml
    end

    Note over StructureWorker,LLM: Phase 3: Slide Planning
    StructureWorker->>LLM: getSlidePlanPrompt() + domain principles
    LLM-->>StructureWorker: Slide Plan (5-7 slides)
    StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: Write debug: 07-phase3-plan.xml

    Note over StructureWorker: Filter schema + rules by selected types
    StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: Filter schema (6 of 13 types)
    StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: Filter slide-type rules (6 of 23)

    Note over StructureWorker,LLM: Phase 4: Content Generation
    StructureWorker->>LLM: getGeneratePrompt() + domain-matched few-shot
    LLM-->>StructureWorker: Complete Carousel XML
    StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: Write debug: 08-phase4-slides.xml

    Note over StructureWorker,LLM: Phase 4.5: Label Detection + Retry
    StructureWorker->>LLM: buildLabelDetectionPrompt()
    LLM-->>StructureWorker: Label classification per slide
    alt Labels found (retry budget: 2)
        StructureWorker->>LLM: buildRetryPrompt()
        LLM-->>StructureWorker: Fixed headlines
    end
    StructureWorker->>StructureWorker: Write debug: 13-final-slides.json

    alt needs_review (all retries exhausted)
        StructureWorker->>API: markNeedsReview()
    else success
        StructureWorker->>API: Store slides, update status
        StructureWorker->>API: clearCheckpoint()
    end

    StructureWorker->>API: Publish to outbox → render queue

    Note over RenderWorker: Phase 5: Render
    API->>RenderWorker: Dequeue job
    RenderWorker->>RenderWorker: Generate images with Playwright
    RenderWorker->>RenderWorker: Conditional text gen (LinkedIn/Twitter)
    RenderWorker->>RenderWorker: Write debug: 06-rendered.json
    RenderWorker->>API: Update job (status: complete)
